  "prompt": "The analytics team defines sessions with a gap of 30 minutes or more. Count each account's app sessions in November 2025, using only the app events from 1 to 30 November 2025 (UTC days of event_ts). A user's first app event in November starts a session, and an event 30 minutes or more after the same user's previous event starts a new one, so a gap of exactly 30 minutes starts a new session. Measure each gap as the time between the two moments in event_ts, a UTC instant. Return two columns, in this order: account_id and sessions. Return one row for each account with app events in November. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "account_id",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
      {
        "name": "sessions",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      }
    ],
    "grain": null
  },
